   "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Draft \u2014 Ember & Oak Coffee</title><style>:root{--bg:#f7f3ec;--ink:#241c14;--muted:#6b5d4d;--accent:#9a5b32;--radius:6px;--space-unit:8px;--font-scale:1}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.5}.wrap{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:calc(6*var(--space-unit)) calc(4*var(--space-unit))}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:calc(4*var(--space-unit));border-bottom:1px solid #e4dbcb}nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.85rem;margin-left:calc(2.5*var(--space-unit))}h1{font-size:calc(var(--font-scale)*3.4rem);line-height:1.08;margin:.8em 0 .4em;letter-spacing:-.01em}p.lede{font-size:calc(var(--font-scale)*1.15rem);color:var(--muted);max-width:52ch}a.cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:calc(3*var(--space-unit));background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:var(--radius);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem}.origins{margin-top:calc(7*var(--space-unit));display:flex;gap:calc(4*var(--space-unit))}.origin{flex:1;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:calc(2*var(--space-unit))}.origin h3{margin:0 0 .25em;font-size:1rem}.origin p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.draft{margin-top:calc(6*var(--space-unit));font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;color:#b3a68f;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}@media(max-width:640px){.origins{flex-direction:column}}</style></head><body><div class=\"wrap\"><header><strong>Ember &amp; Oak</strong><nav><a href=\"#\">Beans</a><a href=\"#\">Subscriptions</a><a href=\"#\">Visit</a></nav></header><main><h1>Coffee roasted the slow way, since 1987.</h1><p class=\"lede\">Small-batch roasting over oak embers. No automation, no shortcuts \u2014 just a drum, a fire, and someone paying attention.</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Shop this week's roast</a><div class=\"origins\"><div class=\"origin\"><h3>Yirgacheffe</h3><p>Washed \u00b7 floral, bergamot finish</p></div><div class=\"origin\"><h3>Huila</h3><p>Honey \u00b7 caramel, red apple</p></div><div class=\"origin\"><h3>Nyeri</h3><p>Natural \u00b7 blackberry, cocoa</p></div></div><p class=\"draft\">Draft sample content</p></main></div></body></html>",
